---
import type { Service } from '../data/site';

type Props = { service: Service };
const { service } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="service-guide-title">
  <div class="container service-guide">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Antes do contato</span>
        <h2 id="service-guide-title">Informações para orientar o atendimento.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Os sinais ajudam na conversa inicial, mas a definição do serviço depende da avaliação do ambiente.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-guide-grid">
      <article data-reveal>
        <span class="service-guide-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Sinais que merecem avaliação</h3>
        <ul>
          {service.details.signs.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <span class="service-guide-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Como o atendimento é orientado</h3>
        <ol>
          {service.details.approach.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ol>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <span class="service-guide-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>Como se preparar</h3>
        <ul>
          {service.details.preparation.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article data-reveal>
        <span class="service-guide-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <h3>Cuidados posteriores</h3>
        <ul>
          {service.details.aftercare.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft" aria-labelledby="service-faq-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Dúvidas sobre {service.name.toLowerCase()}</span>
        <h2 id="service-faq-title">O que confirmar antes de agendar.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>As orientações finais variam conforme o método, a estrutura e a rotina do imóvel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      {service.details.faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details data-reveal>
          <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
          <p>{faq.answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
